---
---

<div class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
  <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] sm:items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-700">Weekly intelligence</span>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">获取每周评测更新</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        新评测、节点速度变化、流媒体解锁状态，每周五发送，不做任何广告。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <form class="flex gap-2" onsubmit="return false;" aria-label="订阅表单">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          class="min-w-0 flex-1 border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 transition-colors focus:border-brand-500"
          aria-label="邮箱地址"
          autocomplete="email"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="bg-ink px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#fbf8f0] hover:bg-brand-700">订阅</button>
      </form>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400">无垃圾邮件，随时退订。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
